        main_activity: 'Each student builds a personal "Success Routine" on a one-page template with three parts. Daily: update my one tracker at ___ (time). Study: use ___ active strategy for tests. When stuck: use my start switch ___ and my Comeback Card. Students then map an actual upcoming week — plug in their real assignments and tests from their tracker and block out when they will start each one. Pairs swap plans and give each other one piece of encouragement and one realistic tip. Counselor circulates to make sure each plan is doable, not overloaded.',
        closing_checkout: 'Certificate ceremony. Each student completes: "The study or motivation habit I will actually keep is ___."',
