        closing_checkout: 'Certificate ceremony. Each student completes: "The coping skill I trust most now is ___." Counselor reminds the group the door is always open and reviews how to reach support.',
        take_home_challenge: 'Keep your Coping Plan somewhere private but reachable. Take your next ladder rung when ready, and reach out early if the warning signs show up.',
